exports[`recorded output: exponent-divide > matches the wording recorded when the skill landed 1`] = `
"--- exponent-divide · seed 1 · difficulty 1
prompt   What is the missing exponent?
display  math "3 to the 3 divided by 3 to the 1 equals 3 to the blank power" row(superscript("3", "3"), " ÷ ", superscript("3", "1"), " = ", superscript("3", "?")) [power-divide 3^3 3^1]
answer   exact 2/1
input    keypad
hint     When dividing same-base powers, subtract the exponents.
step 1   Keep the base and subtract the exponents.   [3 − 1 = 2]
step 2   Write the result as a single power.   [3^2]
miss     added-exponents = 4   Same-base division subtracts the exponents, not adds them.

--- exponent-divide · seed 12345 · difficulty 1
prompt   What is the missing exponent?
display  math "4 to the 2 divided by 4 to the 1 equals 4 to the blank power" row(superscript("4", "2"), " ÷ ", superscript("4", "1"), " = ", superscript("4", "?")) [power-divide 4^2 4^1]
answer   exact 1/1
input    keypad
hint     When dividing same-base powers, subtract the exponents.
step 1   Keep the base and subtract the exponents.   [2 − 1 = 1]
